#: src/common/glossary.adoc:348
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Stepper Motor"
msgid "stepper motor"
msgstr "Moteurs pas à pas"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/common/glossary.adoc:348
msgid ""
"A type of motor that turns in fixed steps. By counting steps, it is possible "
"to determine how far the motor has turned. If the load exceeds the torque "
"capability of the motor, it will skip one or more steps, causing position "
"errors."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/common/glossary.adoc:352
msgid ""
"The module within LinuxCNC that coordinates the overall execution and "
"interprets the part program."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
