msgid "Variables"
msgstr "les variables."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:90
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "A variable line is made up of a variable name, an equals sign (=), and a "
#| "value. Everything from the first non-white space character after the = up "
#| "to the end of the line is passed as the value, so you can embed spaces in "
#| "string symbols if you want to or need to. A variable name is often called "
#| "a keyword."
msgid ""
"A variable line is made up of a variable name, an equals sign (`=`), and a "
"value.  Everything from the first non-white space character after the `=` up "
"to the end of the line is passed as the value, so you can embed spaces in "
"string symbols if you want to or need to.  A variable name is often called a "
"keyword."
msgstr ""
"Une ligne de variables est composée d'un nom de variable, du signe égal (=) "
"et d'une valeur. Tout, du premier caractère non blanc qui suit le signe = "
"jusque la fin de la ligne, est passé comme valeur à la variable. Vous pouvez "
"donc intercaler des espaces entre les symboles si besoin. Un nom de variable "
"est souvent appelé un mot clé."

#. type: Block title
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "Variable Example"
msgstr "Exemple de variable"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "MACHINE = My Machine\n"
msgstr "MACHINE = Ma Machine\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:100
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "A variable line may be extended to multiple lines with a terminal "
#| "backslash (\\)  character.  A maximum of MAX_EXTEND_LINES (==20) are "
#| "allowed.  There must be no whitespace following the trailing backslash "
#| "character."
msgid ""
"A variable line may be extended to multiple lines with a terminal backslash "
"(\\) character.  A maximum of `MAX_EXTEND_LINES` (==20) are allowed.  There "
"must be no whitespace following the trailing backslash character."
msgstr ""
"Une ligne variable peut être étendue à plusieurs lignes à l'aide d'une barre "
"oblique inversée terminale (\\).  Un maximum de MAX_EXTEND_LINES (==20) est "
"autorisé.  Il ne doit pas y avoir d'espace blanc après la barre oblique "
"inversée de fin de ligne."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:102
msgid "Section identifiers may not be extended to multiple lines."
msgstr ""
"Les identifiants de section ne peuvent pas être étendus à plusieurs lignes."

