"`TYPE = LINEAR` - The type of this axis, either `LINEAR` or `ANGULAR`.  "
"Required if this axis is not a default axis type.  The default axis types "
"are X,Y,Z,U,V,W = LINEAR and A,B,C = ANGULAR.  This setting is effective "
