#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:923
msgid ""
"`MAX_ACCELERATION = 20.0` - Maximum acceleration for this axis in machine "
"units per second squared."
msgstr ""
"`MAX_ACCELERATION = 20.0` - Accélération maximum pour cet axe en unités "
"machine par seconde au carré."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:926
msgid ""
"`MAX_JERK = 0.0` - Maximum jerk for this axis in machine units per second "
"cubed.  Used when S-curve trajectory planning is enabled.  When set to 0 "
"(default), no per-axis jerk limiting is applied."
msgstr ""

#. type: Index entry
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:930 src/config/ini-config.adoc:1047
msgid "MIN LIMIT"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:930
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "`MIN_LIMIT = -1000` - (((MIN LIMIT))) The minimum limit (soft limit) for "
#| "axis motion, in machine units.  When this limit is exceeded, the "
#| "controller aborts axis motion.  The axis must be homed before `MIN_LIMIT` "
#| "is in force.  For a rotary axis (A,B,C typ)  with unlimited rotation "
#| "having no `MIN_LIMIT` for that axis in the `[AXIS_`<letter>`]` section a "
#| "value of -1e99 is used."
msgid ""
"`MIN_LIMIT = -1000` - The minimum limit (soft limit) for axis motion, in "
"machine units.  When this limit is exceeded, the controller aborts axis "
"motion.  The axis must be homed before `MIN_LIMIT` is in force.  For a "
"rotary axis (A,B,C typ)  with unlimited rotation having no `MIN_LIMIT` for "
"that axis in the `[AXIS_`<letter>`]` section a value of -1e99 is used."
msgstr ""
"`MIN_LIMIT = -1000` - (((MIN LIMIT))) Limite minimale (limite souple) pour "
"le mouvement de l'axe, en unités de machine.  Lorsque cette limite est "
"dépassée, le contrôleur interrompt le mouvement de l'axe.  L'axe doit être "
"en mode homéopathique avant que `MIN_LIMIT` ne soit en vigueur.  Pour un axe "
"rotatif (type A,B,C) à rotation illimitée n'ayant pas de `MIN_LIMIT` pour "
"cet axe dans la section `[AXIS_`<lettre>`]`, une valeur de -1e99 est "
"utilisée."

#. type: Index entry
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:934 src/config/ini-config.adoc:1051
msgid "MAX LIMIT"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:934
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "`MAX_LIMIT = 1000` - (((MAX LIMIT))) The maximum limit (soft limit) for "
#| "axis motion, in machine units.  When this limit is exceeded, the "
#| "controller aborts axis motion.  The axis must be homed before MAX_LIMIT "
#| "is in force.  For a rotary axis (A,B,C typ) with unlimited rotation "
#| "having no `MAX_LIMIT` for that axis in the `[AXIS_`<letter>`]` section a "
#| "value of 1e99 is used."
msgid ""
"`MAX_LIMIT = 1000` - The maximum limit (soft limit) for axis motion, in "
"machine units.  When this limit is exceeded, the controller aborts axis "
"motion.  The axis must be homed before MAX_LIMIT is in force.  For a rotary "
"axis (A,B,C typ) with unlimited rotation having no `MAX_LIMIT` for that axis "
"in the `[AXIS_`<letter>`]` section a value of 1e99 is used."
msgstr ""
"'MAX_LIMIT = 1000' - (((MAX LIMIT))) Limite maximale des mouvements de cet "
"axe (limite logicielle), en unités machine. Quand cette limite tend à être "
"dépassée, le contrôleur arrête le mouvement.  For a rotary axis (A,B,C typ) "
"with unlimited rotation having no MAX_LIMIT for that axis in the "
"[AXIS_<letter>] section a value of 1e99 is used."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:936
msgid ""
"`WRAPPED_ROTARY = 1` - When this is set to 1 for an ANGULAR axis the axis "
"will move 0-359.999 degrees.  Positive Numbers will move the axis in a "
"positive direction and negative numbers will move the axis in the negative "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"`WRAPPED_ROTARY = 1` - Lorsque ce paramètre est réglé à 1 pour un axe "
"angulaire l'axe se déplace de 0 à 359.999 degrés. Les nombres positifs "
"déplacent l'axe dans le sens positif et les nombres négatifs dans le sens "
"négatif."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/ini-config.adoc:942
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "`LOCKING_INDEXER_JOINT = 4` - This value selects a joint to use for a "
#| "locking indexer for the specified axis <letter>.  In this example, the "
#| "joint is 4 which would correspond to the B axis for a XYZAB system with "
#| "trivkins (identity) kinematics.  When set, a G0 move for this axis will "
#| "initiate an unlock with the `joint.4.unlock pin` then wait for the "
#| "`joint.4.is-unlocked` pin then move the joint at the rapid rate for that "
#| "joint.  After the move the `joint.4.unlock` will be false and motion will "
#| "wait for `joint.4.is-unlocked` to go false.  Moving with other joints is "
#| "not allowed when moving a locked rotary joint.  To create the unlock "
#| "pins, use the motmod parameter:"
msgid ""
"`LOCKING_INDEXER_JOINT = 4` - This value selects a joint to use for a "
"locking indexer for the specified axis _<letter>_.  In this example, the "
"joint is 4 which would correspond to the B axis for a XYZAB system with "
"trivkins (identity) kinematics.  When set, a G0 move for this axis will "
"initiate an unlock with the `joint.4.unlock pin` then wait for the "
"`joint.4.is-unlocked` pin then move the joint at the rapid rate for that "
"joint.  After the move the `joint.4.unlock` will be false and motion will "
"wait for `joint.4.is-unlocked` to go false.  Moving with other joints is not "
"allowed when moving a locked rotary joint.  To create the unlock pins, use "
"the motmod parameter:"
msgstr ""
"`LOCKING_INDEXER_JOINT = 4` - Cette valeur sélectionne une articulation à "
"utiliser comme indexeur de verrouillage pour l'axe <lettre> spécifié.  Dans "
"cet exemple, l'articulation est 4, ce qui correspond à l'axe B d'un système "
"XYZAB avec une cinématique trivkins (identité).  Lorsqu'il est défini, un "
"mouvement G0 pour cet axe déclenche un déverrouillage avec la broche "
"`joint.4.unlock pin`, puis attend la broche `joint.4.is-unlocked` et déplace "
"l'articulation à la vitesse rapide pour cette articulation.  Après le "
"mouvement, `joint.4.unlock` sera faux et le mouvement attendra que "
"`joint.4.is-unlocked` devienne faux.  Le déplacement avec d'autres "
"articulations n'est pas autorisé lors du déplacement d'une articulation "
"rotative verrouillée.  Pour créer les broches de déverrouillage, utilisez le "
"paramètre motmod :"

#. type: delimited block -
