msgid ""
"'(returns dict of tooldata for toolno)' - An initial stat.poll() is required to initialize. _toolno_ must be greater than zero and less than or equal to the highest tool number in use. Dictionary items include all tooldata items: 'toolno', 'pocketno', 'diameter','frontangle','backangle','orientation', 'xoffset','yoffset', ...  'woffset', 'comment'.\n"
