#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Parallel Port 1 Setup Page"
msgstr "Page de réglage du port parallèle"

#. type: Target for macro image
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:120
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "images/stepconf-parallel-1_en.png"
msgstr "images/stepconf-pinout_fr.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:123
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You may specify the address as a hexadecimal (often 0x378) or as linux's "
"default port number (probably 0)"
msgstr ""
"You may specify the address as a hexadecimal (often 0x378) or as linux's "
"default port number (probably 0)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:126
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For each pin, choose the signal which matches your parallel port pinout.  "
"Turn on the 'invert' check box if the signal is inverted (0V for true/"
"active, 5V for false/inactive)."
msgstr ""
"Pour chacune des broches, choisir le signal correspondant au brochage entre "
"le port parallèle et l'interface matérielle. Cocher la case inverser si le "
"signal est inversé (0V pour vrai/actif, 5V pour faux/inactif)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:130
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'Output pinout presets' - Automatically set pins 2 through 9 according to "
"the Sherline standard (Direction on pins 2, 4, 6, 8) or the Xylotex standard "
"(Direction on pins 3, 5, 7, 9)."
msgstr ""
"_Sorties présélectionnées_ - (((Sorties présélectionnées))) Réglage "
"automatique des pins 2 à 9 Direction sur les pins 2, 4, 6, 8, selon le _type "
"Sherline_ Direction sur les pins 3, 5, 7, 9, selon le _type Xylotex_"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:131
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'Inputs and Outputs' - If the input or output is not used set the option to "
"'Unused'."
msgstr ""
"_Entrées et sorties_ - Les entrées ou les sorties non utilisées doivent être "
"placées sur Inutilisé."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:133
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'External E-Stop' - This can be selected from an input pin drop down box.  A "
"typical E-Stop chain uses all normally closed contacts."
msgstr ""
"_Sortie arrêt d'urgence_ - Sélectionnable dans la liste déroulante des "
"sorties. La sortie d'arrêt d'urgence est utilisée pour actionner l'organe de "
"coupure du circuit de puissance de la machine. Le contact de cet organe est "
"câblé en série avec les contacts des boutons d'arrêt d'urgence extérieurs "
"ainsi qu'avec tous les contacts compris dans la boucle d'arrêt d'urgence."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:135
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'Homing & Limit Switches' - These can be selected from an input pin drop "
"down box for most configurations."
msgstr ""
"'Homing & Limit Switches' - These can be selected from an input pin drop "
"down box for most configurations."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:139
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'Charge Pump' - If your driver board requires a charge pump signal select "
"Charge Pump from the drop down list for the output pin you wish to connect "
"to your charge pump input.  The charge pump output is connected to the base "
"thread by StepConf.  The charge pump output will be about 1/2 of the maximum "
"step rate shown on the Basic Machine Configuration page."
msgstr ""
"_Pompe de charge_ - Si la carte de contrôle accepte un signal pompe de "
"charge, dans la liste déroulante des sorties, sélectionner _Pompe de charge_ "
"sur la sortie correspondant à l'entrée Pompe de charge de la carte de "
"contrôle. La sortie pompe de charge sera connectée en interne par Stepconf.  "
"Le signal de pompe de charge sera d'environ la moitié de la fréquence maxi "
"des pas affichée sur la page des informations machine."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:141
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'Plasma Arc Voltage' - If you require a Mesa THCAD to input a plasma arc "
"voltage then select Plasma Arc Voltage from the list of output pins.  This "
"will enable a THCAD page during the setup procedure for the entry of the "
"card parameters."
msgstr ""
"'Plasma Arc Voltage' - If you require a Mesa THCAD to input a plasma arc "
"voltage then select Plasma Arc Voltage from the list of output pins.  This "
"will enable a THCAD page during the setup procedure for the entry of the "
"card parameters."

#. type: Title ==
#: src/config/stepconf.adoc:142
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Parallel Port 2 Setup"
msgstr "Parallel Port 2 Setup"

#. type: Positional ($1) AttributeList argument for macro 'image'
