msgid ""
"(valid for outputs only). If any pins are allocated to the \"reset\" list "
"then a HAL parameter *hal_gpio.reset_ns* will be created. This will have no "
"effect unless the *hal_gpio.reset* function is added to a realtime thread. "
"This should be placed after the *hal_gpio.write* function and must be in the "
"same thread. The behaviour of this function is equivalent to the same "
