#. type: Plain text
#: src/drivers/mitsub-vfd.adoc:36
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The above command says:\n"
"loadusr, wait for coolant pins to be ready, component mitsub_vfd, with 2 slaves named spindle (slave #2) and coolant (slave #1)"
msgstr "En anglais ça donne 'loadusr wait for name spindle component gs2_vfd name spindle'. Le -n spindle est une partie du composant gs2_vfd et non de la commande loadusr."

