"PWM.  Si _scale_ vaut X, alors le rapport cyclique sera de 100% quand "
"_value_ de la pin vaudra X (ou -X)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/drivers/pico-ppmc.adoc:194
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'(UPC float) ppmc.<port>.pwm.<channel>.max-dc' - Maximum duty cycle, from "
"0.0 to 1.0."
msgstr ""
"'(UPC float) ppmc.<port>.pwm.<channel>.max-dc' - Rapport cyclique maximum, "
"compris entre 0.0 et 1.0."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/drivers/pico-ppmc.adoc:196
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'(UPC float) ppmc.<port>.pwm.<channel>.min-dc' - Minimum duty cycle, from "
