msgid "G98"
msgstr "G8\n"

#. type: Index entry
#: src/gcode/g-code.adoc:2732
#, fuzzy
msgid "G99 Canned Cycle Return"
msgstr "Mode de retrait"

#. type: Title ==
#: src/gcode/g-code.adoc:2732
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "G98, G99 Canned Cycle Return Level"
msgstr "Mode de retrait"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/g-code.adoc:2736
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When spindle retracts during canned cycles, there are two options to choose "
"from for the way it does it:"
msgstr ""
"Quand la broche se rétracte pendant les cycles de perçage, il existe deux "
"options pour indiquer comment elle doit se rétracter:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/g-code.adoc:2739
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'G98' - retract to the position that axis was in just before this series of "
"one or more contiguous canned cycles was started."
msgstr ""
"'G98' Retrait perpendiculaire au plan de travail courant jusqu'à la position "
"qui était celle de cet axe juste avant le début d'un ou plusieurs cycle(s) "
"pré-programmés."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/g-code.adoc:2741
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'G99' - retract to the position specified by the R word of the canned cycle."
msgstr ""
"'G99' Retrait perpendiculaire au plan de travail courant jusqu'à la position "
"indiquée par le mot 'R'."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/g-code.adoc:2747
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Program a 'G98' and the canned cycle will use the Z position prior to the "
"canned cycle as the Z return position if it is higher than the R value "
"specified in the cycle. If it is lower, the R value will be used. The R word "
"has different meanings in absolute distance mode and incremental distance "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Programmez un 'G98' et le cycle pré-programmé utilisera la dernière position "
"en Z préalable comme position de retour si elle est supérieure à la valeur R "
"spécifiée dans le cycle.  Si elle est inférieure, c'est cette dernière qui "
"serait utilisée. Ne pas oublier que la signification du mot R change selon "
"que le mode de déplacement est absolu ou relatif."

#. type: Block title
#: src/gcode/g-code.adoc:2748
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "G98 Retract to Origin"
msgstr "G98 Retract to Origin"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gcode/g-code.adoc:2753
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"G0 X1 Y2 Z3\n"
"G90 G98 G81 X4 Y5 Z-0.6 R1.8 F10\n"
msgstr ""
"G0 X1 Y2 Z3\n"
"G90 G98 G81 X4 Y5 Z-0.6 R1.8 F10\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/g-code.adoc:2758
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The G98 to the second line above means that the return move will be to the "
"value of Z in the first line since it is higher that the R value specified."
msgstr ""
"The G98 to the second line above means that the return move will be to the "
"value of Z in the first line since it is higher that the R value specified."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/g-code.adoc:2764
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The 'initial' (G98) plane is reset any time cycle motion mode is abandoned, "
"whether explicitly (G80) or implicitly (any motion code that is not a "
"cycle). Switching among cycle modes (say G81 to G83) does NOT reset the "
"'initial' plane. It is possible to switch between G98 and G99 during a "
"series of cycles."
msgstr ""
"Le plan de retrait initial (G98) est annulé chaque fois que le mode de "
"mouvement est abandonné, que ce soit explicitement avec G80 ou implicitement "
"(tout code de mouvement qui n'est pas un cycle).  Basculer d'un mode de "
"cycle à un autre, par exemple entre G81 et G83 n'annule pas le plan de "
"retrait initial. Il est permis de basculer entre G98 et G99 durant une série "
"de cycles de perçage."

