#. type: Index entry
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:613 src/gcode/m-code.adoc:618
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "M73 Save and Autorestore Modal State"
msgstr "Restauration sélective de l'état modal"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:618
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To save modal state within a subroutine, and restore state on subroutine "
"'endsub' or any 'return' path, program 'M73'."
msgstr ""
"Pour enregistrer l'état modal à l'intérieur d'un sous-programme et restaurer "
"cet état lors d'un 'endsub' ou autre 'return', programmer 'M73'."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:621
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Aborting a running program in a subroutine which has an 'M73' operation will "
"*not* restore state ."
msgstr ""
"En cas d'abandon d'un programme en cours d'exécution dans un sous-programme "
"traitant un 'M73', l'état ne sera *PAS* restauré."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:624
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Also, the normal end ('M2') of a main program which contains an 'M73' will "
"*not* restore state."
msgstr ""
"En outre, la fin normale ('M2') d'un programme principal contenant un 'M73' "
"ne restaurera *pas* l'état."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:631
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The suggested use is at the beginning of a O-word subroutine as in the "
"following example. Using 'M73' this way enables designing subroutines which "
"need to modify modal state but will protect the calling program against "
"inadvertent modal changes. Note the use of <<gcode:predefined-named-"
"parameters,predefined named parameters>> in the 'showstate' subroutine."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisation suggérée consiste à placer au début d'un sous-programme, un O-"
"code de sous-programme comme dans l'exemple ci-dessous. En utilisant 'M73', "
"cette manière valide le design des sous-programmes qui doivent modifier "
"l'état modal mais qui protège le programme appelant contre tout changement "
"inopiné de l'état modal. Noter l'usage de <<gcode:predefined-named-"
"parameters, paramètres nommés>> dans le sous-programme 'showstate'."

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gcode/m-code.adoc:646
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"O<imperialsub> sub\n"
"M73 (save caller state in current call context, restore on return or endsub)\n"
"g20 (imperial)\n"
"g91 (relative mode)\n"
"F5 (low feed)\n"
"S300 (low rpm)\n"
"(debug, in subroutine, state now:)\n"
"o<showstate> call\n"
msgstr ""
"O<imperialsub> sub\n"
"M73 (save caller state in current call context, restore on return or endsub)\n"
"g20 (imperial)\n"
"g91 (relative mode)\n"
"F5 (low feed)\n"
"S300 (low rpm)\n"
"(debug, in subroutine, state now:)\n"
"o<showstate> call\n"

#. type: delimited block -
