#. type: Title ==
#: src/gcode/o-code.adoc:242
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Looping"
msgstr "Réglage de la boucle"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/o-code.adoc:249
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The 'while loop' has two structures: 'while/endwhile', and 'do/while'. In "
"each case, the loop is exited when the 'while' condition evaluates to false. "
"The difference is when the test condition is done. The 'do/while' loop runs "
"the code in the loop then checks the test condition. The 'while/endwhile' "
"loop does the test first."
msgstr ""
"La boucle 'while' a deux structures possibles: 'while - endwhile' et 'do - "
"while'.  Dans chaque cas, la boucle est quittée quand la condition du "
"'while' devient fausse. La différence se trouve en fin de test de la "
"condition. La boucle 'do - while' exécute le code dans la boucle puis test "
"la condition.  La boucle 'while - endwhile' effectue le test d'abord."

#. type: Block title
#: src/gcode/o-code.adoc:250
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "While Endwhile Example"
msgstr "Exemple avec 'while - endwhile'"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gcode/o-code.adoc:263
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(draw a sawtooth shape)\n"
"G0 X1 Y0 (move to start position)\n"
"#1 = 0 (assign parameter #1 the value of 0)\n"
"F25 (set a feed rate)\n"
"o101 while [#1 LT 10]\n"
"  G1 X0\n"
"  G1 Y[#1/10] X1\n"
"  #1 = [#1+1] (increment the test counter)\n"
"o101 endwhile\n"
"M2 (end program)\n"
msgstr ""
"(dessine la forme d'une dent de scie)\n"
"G0 X1 Y0 (déplacement en position de départ)\n"
"#1 = 1 (assigne la valeur 1 au paramètre #1)\n"
"F25 (fixe la vitesse d'avance travail)\n"
"o101 while [#1 LT 10]\n"
"  G1 X0\n"
"  G1 Y[#1/10] X1\n"
"  #1 = [#1+1] (incrémente le compteur de test)\n"
"o101 endwhile\n"
"M2 (fin de programme)\n"

#. type: Block title
#: src/gcode/o-code.adoc:265
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Do While Example"
msgstr "Exemple avec 'do - while'"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gcode/o-code.adoc:281
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#1 = 0 (assign parameter #1 the value of 0)\n"
"o100 do\n"
"  (debug, parameter 1 = #1)\n"
"  o110 if [#1 EQ 2]\n"
"    #1 = 3 (assign the value of 3 to parameter #1)\n"
"    (msg, #1 has been assigned the value of 3)\n"
"    o100 continue (skip to start of loop)\n"
"  o110 endif\n"
"  (some code here)\n"
"  #1 = [#1 + 1] (increment the test counter)\n"
"o100 while [#1 LT 3]\n"
"(msg, Loop Done!)\n"
"M2\n"
msgstr ""
"#1 = 0 (assigne la valeur 0 au paramètre #1)\n"
"o100 do\n"
"  (debug, paramètre 1 = #1)\n"
"  o110 if [#1 EQ 2]\n"
"    #1 = 3 (assigne la valeur 3 au paramètre #1)\n"
"    (msg, #1 s'est vu assigné la valeur 3)\n"
"    o100 continue (saute au début de la boucle)\n"
"  o110 endif\n"
"  (le code d'usinage ici)\n"
"  #1 = [#1 + 1] (incrémente le compteur de test)\n"
"o100 while [#1 LT 3]\n"
"(msg, boucle terminée)\n"
"M2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/o-code.adoc:287
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Inside a while loop, 'o- break' immediately exits the loop, and 'o- "
"continue' immediately skips to the next evaluation of the 'while' condition. "
"If it is still true, the loop begins again at the top. If it is false, it "
"exits the loop."
msgstr ""
"À l'intérieur d'une boucle while, 'O- break', quitte immédiatement la boucle "
"et 'O- continue', saute immédiatement à la prochaine évaluation de la "
"condition du 'while'. Si elle est vraie, la boucle recommence au début. Si "
"elle est fausse, la boucle est quittée."

#. type: Index entry
