"N02 G43 H1 Z0 X1\n"
"N03 G49 X0 Z0\n"
"N04 G0 X2\n"
"N05 G1 G43 H1 G4 P10 Z0 X3\n"
"N06 G49 X2 Z0\n"
"N07 G0 X0\n"
msgstr ""
