#. type: Plain text
#: src/getting-started/system-requirements.adoc:40
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Minimum hardware requirements change as Linux distributions evolve so check "
"the https://www.debian.org/releases/devel/amd64/ch02.en.html[Debian] web "
