#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/gladevcp.adoc:241
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You might wonder why widgets contained a 'HAL_Hbox' or 'HAL_Table' appear "
"greyed out (inactive).  HAL containers have an associated HAL pin which is "
"off by default, which causes all contained widgets to render inactive.  A "
"common use case would be to associate these container HAL pins with "
"`halui.machine.is-on` or one of the `halui.mode` signals, to assure some "
"widgets appear active only in a certain state."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous demandez peut être pourquoi les widgets conteneurs comme "
