"See <<cha:qtvcp,QtVCP>> for more information about QtVCP in general.\n"
"Custom modifications can be added by 'subclassing' the handler file. This adds code on top of the original.\n"
"QtDragon can also utilize QtVCP's rc file to do minor python code modifications without using a custom handler file."
