#. type: Index entry
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:544
#, fuzzy
msgid "HAL weighted_sum"
msgstr "weighted_sum"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:544
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The weighted sum converts a group of bits into an integer.  The conversion "
"is the sum of the 'weights' of the bits present plus any offset.  It's "
"similar to 'binary coded decimal' but with more options.  The 'hold' bit "
"interrupts the input processing, so that the 'sum' value no longer changes."
msgstr ""
"La somme pondérée converti un groupe de bits en un entier. La conversion est "
"la somme des 'poids' des bits présents plus n'importe quel offset. C'est "
"similaire au 'binaire codé décimal' mais avec plus d'options. Le bit 'hold' "
"interrompt le traitement des entrées, de sorte que la valeur 'sum' ne change "
"plus."

#. type: Block title
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:545
#, no-wrap
msgid "Syntax for loading component `weighted_sum`"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:549
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "loadrt weighted_sum wsum_sizes=size[,size,...]\n"
msgstr "loadrt weighted_sum wsum_sizes=size[,size,...]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:552
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Creates groups of ``weighted_sum``s, each with the given number of input "
"bits (size)."
msgstr ""
"Crée des groupes de weighted_sum, chacun avec le nombre donné de bits "
"d'entrée (size)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:554
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To update the `weighted_sum`, the `process_wsums` must be attached to a "
"thread."
msgstr ""
"Pour mettre à jour la weighted_sum, le process_wsums doit être attaché à un "
"thread."

#. type: Block title
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:555
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Add `process_wsums` to servo thread"
msgstr "addf process_wsums servo-thread\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:559
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "addf process_wsums servo-thread\n"
msgstr "addf process_wsums servo-thread\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:562
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which updates the `weighted_sum` component."
msgstr "Ce qui met à jour le composant weighted_sum."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/basic-hal.adoc:565
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the following example, a copy of the AXIS HAL configuration window, bits "
"'0' and '2' are TRUE, they have no offset.  The weight ('weight') of bit 0 "
"is 1, that of bit 2 is 4, so the sum is 5."
