#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/components.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The one or other setup of a UNIX system may require to explicitly specify "
"the section of the man page.  If you do not find the man page or the name of "
"the man page is already taken by another UNIX tool with the LinuxCNC man "
"page residing in another section, then try to explicitly specify the "
"section, as in `man _section-no_ axis`, with _section-no_ = 1 for non-"
"realtime and 9 for realtime components."
msgstr ""

