msgstr "<device-name>"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/general-ref.adoc:76
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The device that the driver is intended to work with.  This is most often an "
"interface board of some type, but there are other possibilities."
msgstr ""
"Le matériel avec lequel le pilote est sensé travailler. Il s'agit le plus "
