#. type: Title ==
#: src/hal/hal-examples.adoc:164
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Soft Start Details"
msgstr "Amortissement d'un signal"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/hal-examples.adoc:167
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This example shows how the HAL components 'lowpass', 'limit2' or 'limit3' "
"can be used to limit how fast a signal changes."
msgstr ""
"Cette exemple montre comment les composants de HAL _lowpass_, _limit2_ ou "
"_limit3_ peuvent être utilisés pour amortir de brusques changements d'un "
"signal."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/hal-examples.adoc:172
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In this example we have a servo motor driving a lathe spindle.  If we just "
"used the commanded spindle speeds on the servo it will try to go from "
"present speed to commanded speed as fast as it can.  This could cause a "
"problem or damage the drive.  To slow the rate of change we can send the "
"`spindle.N.speed-out` through a limiter before the PID, so that the PID "
"command value changes to new settings more slowly."
msgstr ""
"Nous sommes sur un tour dont la broche est pilotée par un servomoteur. Si "
"nous envoyions directement la consigne de vitesse de broche sur le servo, "
"celui-ci chercherait, à partir de la vitesse courante, à atteindre la "
"vitesse commandée le plus vite possible. Cette situation est problématique "
"et peut détériorer le matériel. Pour amortir ce changement de vitesse, nous "
"pouvons faire passer la sortie _spindle.N.speed-out_ à travers un limiteur "
"avant d'aller au PID, de sorte que la valeur de commande du PID soit amortie."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/hal-examples.adoc:174
#, fuzzy
msgid "Three built-in components that limit a signal are:"
msgstr "Les trois composants intégrés pour amortir le signal seront:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/hal-examples.adoc:176
#, fuzzy
msgid "'limit2' limits the range and first derivative of a signal."
msgstr ""
"'limit2' Limite le signal de sortie pour qu’il soit entre min et max. Limite "
"sa vitesse de montée à moins de MaxV par seconde. (dérivée première)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/hal-examples.adoc:177
#, fuzzy
msgid "'limit3' limits the range, first and second derivatives of a signal."
msgstr ""
"'limit3' Limite le signal de sortie pour qu’il soit entre min et max. Limite "
"sa vitesse de montée à moins de MaxV par seconde. (dérivée première). Limite "
"sa vitesse de montée à moins de MaxV par seconde^2^. (dérivée seconde)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/hal-examples.adoc:178
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"'lowpass' uses an exponentially-weighted moving average to track an input "
"signal."
msgstr "'lowpass' Filtre passe-bas."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/hal-examples.adoc:180
#, fuzzy
msgid "To find more information on these HAL components check the man pages."
msgstr ""
"Pour plus de détails voir <<sec:hal-components, les composants de HAL>> ou "
"les man pages des composants concernés."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/hal-examples.adoc:183
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Place the following in a text file called softstart.hal.  If you're not "
"familiar with Linux place the file in your home directory."
msgstr ""
"Placer le code suivant dans un fichier appelé 'softstart.hal'. FIXME If "
"you're not familiar with Linux place the file in your home directory."

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/hal/hal-examples.adoc:206
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"loadrt threads period1=1000000 name1=thread\n"
"loadrt siggen\n"
"loadrt lowpass\n"
"loadrt limit2\n"
"loadrt limit3\n"
"net square siggen.0.square => lowpass.0.in limit2.0.in limit3.0.in\n"
"net lowpass <= lowpass.0.out\n"
"net limit2 <= limit2.0.out\n"
"net limit3 <= limit3.0.out\n"
"setp siggen.0.frequency .1\n"
"setp lowpass.0.gain .01\n"
"setp limit2.0.maxv 2\n"
"setp limit3.0.maxv 2\n"
"setp limit3.0.maxa 10\n"
"addf siggen.0.update thread\n"
"addf lowpass.0 thread\n"
"addf limit2.0 thread\n"
"addf limit3.0 thread\n"
"start\n"
"loadusr halscope\n"
msgstr ""
"loadrt threads period1=1000000 name1=thread\n"
"loadrt siggen\n"
"loadrt lowpass\n"
"loadrt limit2\n"
"loadrt limit3\n"
"net square siggen.0.square => lowpass.0.in limit2.0.in limit3.0.in\n"
"net lowpass <= lowpass.0.out\n"
"net limit2 <= limit2.0.out\n"
"net limit3 <= limit3.0.out\n"
"setp siggen.0.frequency .1\n"
"setp lowpass.0.gain .01\n"
"setp limit2.0.maxv 2\n"
"setp limit3.0.maxv 2\n"
"setp limit3.0.maxa 10\n"
"addf siggen.0.update thread\n"
"addf lowpass.0 thread\n"
"addf limit2.0 thread\n"
"addf limit3.0 thread\n"
"start\n"
"loadusr halscope\n"

