#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/halmodule.adoc:77
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The component itself is created by a call to the constructor "
"'hal.component'.  The arguments are the HAL component name and (optionally) "
"the prefix used for pin and parameter names.  If the prefix is not "
"specified, the component name is used."
