"==> ddt.0.in\n"
"==> stepgen.0.position-cmd\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/halshow.adoc:339
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We see that this signal comes from `joint.o.motor-pos-cmd` and goes to both "
"`ddt.0.in` and `stepgen.0.position-cmd`.  By connecting our block to the "
"signal we have avoided any complications with the normal flow of this motion "
"command."
