"#-#-#-#-#  src/gcode/g-code_fr.adoc:949  #-#-#-#-#\n"
"La compensation d'outil est active.\n"
"#-#-#-#-#  src/gcode/g-code_fr.adoc:985  #-#-#-#-#\n"
"La compensation de d'outil est active."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/intro.adoc:65
msgid "listen to what the machine wants to tell about the state it is in."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/intro.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Vertical Abstractions: The human system integrator of such machine uses HAL"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/intro.adoc:67
msgid ""
"to describe what the machine is looking like and how what cable controls "
"which motor that drives which axis."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/intro.adoc:68
msgid ""
"The description of the machine, the programmer's interfaces and the user's "
"interface somehow \"meet\" in that abstract layer."
