#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/rtcomps.adoc:53
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Will install three step generators.  The first two use step type '0' (step "
"and direction) and run in position mode.  The last one uses step type '2' "
"(quadrature) and runs in velocity mode.  The default value for '<config-"
