"The maximum number of step generators is 8 (as defined by MAX_CHAN in "
"stepgen.c).  Each generator is independent, but all are updated by the same "
"function(s) at the same time.  In the following descriptions, _<chan>_ is "
"the number of a specific generator. The first generator is number 0."
