#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/tutorial.adoc:458
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Click on a tab, then click on one of the items to select it. The small "
"window will show the name and value of the selected item.  The display is "
"updated approximately 10 times per second. To free screen space, the "
"selection window can be closed with the _Close_ button.  On the little "
