#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/ladder-intro.adoc:80
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The most common components of ladder are contacts (inputs), these usually "
"are either NC (normally closed) or NO (normally open), and coils (outputs)."
msgstr ""
"Les composants les plus communs du Ladder sont les contacts (entrées), ceux-"
"ci sont habituellement NC (normalement clos) ou NO (normalement ouvert) et "
"les bobines (sorties)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/ladder/ladder-intro.adoc:82
#, fuzzy
