"use designators x,y,z,a. While this arrangement presumes a machine "
"configured as XYZA, the pins can be assigned independently as required in a "
"HAL configuration."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man1/xhc-hb04.1.adoc:36
msgid ""
