"Settings for Automatic Controllers', Transactions of the ASME, link:https://"
"doi.org/10.1115/1.2899060[DOI 10.1115/1.2899060] and link:https://"
"web.archive.org/web/20170918055307/http://staff.guilan.ac.ir/staff/users/"
"chaibakhsh/fckeditor_repo/file/documents/"
"Optimum%20Settings%20for%20Automatic%20Controllers%20(Ziegler%20and%20Nichols,"
"%201942).pdf[The Internet Archive].]. It starts in the same way as the "
"method described before: first set the I and D gains to zero and then "
