msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: src/plasma/qtplasmac.adoc:3970
msgid ""
"It is the responsibility of the operator to ensure that the machine is "
"equipped with a suitable, working hardware E-stop.  If using only a "
"touchscreen to navigate the QtPlasmaC GUI, there is no way to stop automated "
"machine motion on any tab but the MAIN tab."
