"A moving pierce allows the torch to move during the pierce delay period. "
"This has an advantage in that it allows for thicker materials to be pierced "
"than can be achieved with a stationary pierce. It may also support longer "
"consumable life by allowing a style of motion that helps prevent molten "
"material being sprayed up into the torch nozzle."
