#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/eoffset_per_angle.9:199
msgid ""
"The computed offsets are based on the B<radius-ref> pin value\\&. This pin "
"may be set to a constant radius value or controlled by a user interface or "
"by g code program (using B<M68> and a B<motion\\&.analog-out-NN> pin for "
"instance)\\&."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/eoffset_per_angle.9:208
