msgstr ""
"_encoder.<chan>.position-latched_ (float, Out) -- Non utilisé à ce moment."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/pid.9:151
msgid ""
"Proportional gain\\&. Results in a contribution to the output that is the "
"error multiplied by B<Pgain>\\&."
