#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/pid.9:180
#, fuzzy
msgid "B<pid\\&.>I<N>B<\\&.command-deriv> float in"
msgstr ""
"_encoder.<chan>.position-latched_ (float, Out) -- Non utilisé à ce moment."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/pid.9:182
msgid ""
"The derivative of the desired (commanded) value for the control loop\\&. If "
